{"slug":"66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa","title":"ಆಕಾರ ಮತ್ತು ಲಿನಿಯೊ ಸಾಹಸ","titleEn":"Aakaara Matthu Liniyo Saahasa","level":"2","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":547},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":66244,"authors":["Kuzhali  Manickavel "],"illustrators":["Aindri C"],"translators":["Jagadish Shri"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2019","donor":"Oracle","originalStory":{"title":"The Adventures of Akara and Linio"},"copyrightNotice":"'Aakaara Matthu Liniyo Saahasa' was first published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. The development of this book has been supported by Oracle. Guest Editor: Mala Kumar, Guest Art Director: Kaveri Gopalakrishnan. www.prathambooks.org","attributionLine":"ಆಕಾರ ಮತ್ತು ಲಿನಿಯೊ ಸಾಹಸ (Kannada), translated by Jagadish Shri, based on original story The Adventures of Akara and Linio, written by Kuzhali  Manickavel , illustrated by Aindri C, supported by Oracle, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2019) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Red and blue","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":3,"title":"A Red line","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":4,"title":"A Yellow line and a green line","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":5,"title":"A Purple line","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":6,"title":"Few lines are intersecting","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"A line Dog","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"A line Elephant","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"A line Turtle","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"A line Snail","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"A line Owl","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"Many lines","illustrator":"Aindri C","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಆಕಾರ ಮತ್ತು ಲಿನಿಯೊರನ್ನು ಭೇಟಿಯಾಗಿ. ಎರಡೂ ಸರಳರೇಖೆಗಳು. ಆಕಾರ ಉದ್ದಕ್ಕೆ ನಿಂತಿರುವ ಲಂಬ ರೇಖೆ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಲಿನಿಯೊ ಮಲಗಿರುವ ಅಡ್ಡ ರೇಖೆ. ಬನ್ನಿ, ಇವರ ಒಂದಿಷ್ಟು ರೇಖಾ ಗೆಳೆಯರನ್ನು ಭೇಟಿಯಾಗೋಣ!"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಈ ಸೊಟ್ಟ ರೇಖೆಗಳನ್ನು ನೋಡಿದಿರಾ?","ಇವು ಅರ್ಧಚಂದ್ರ ಮತ್ತು ಡೊಂಕಪ್ಪ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇದು ಇಳಿಜಾರು!","ಇದೊಂದು ಜಾರುಬಂಡೆಯ ಹಾಗೆ ವಾಲಿರುವ ರೇಖೆ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಈ ಗೆಳೆಯರು ಒಟ್ಟಾಗಿ ಈದಿನ ಏನು ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ?","ಅವರೆಲ್ಲರೂ ಕೂಡಿ ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳ ಚಿತ್ರಗಳನ್ನು ಬಿಡಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಈ ನಾಯಿಯನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ! ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಮಗೆ ಲಿನಿಯೊ ಎಲ್ಲಿದ್ದಾನೆಂದು ಕಂಡು ಹಿಡಿಯಲು ಆಯಿತೇ?"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ವಾಹ್, ಈ ಆನೆಯನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ! ಅರ್ಧಚಂದ್ರ, ಕಾಣಿಸುತ್ತಾನಾ?"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಓಹೋ, ಇದೊಂದು ಆಮೆ!","ನಿಮಗೆ ಡೊಂಕಪ್ಪನನ್ನು ಕಂಡು ಹಿಡಿಯಲು ಆಯಿತೇ?"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಎಷ್ಟು ಮುದ್ದಾದ ಬಸವನಹುಳು!","ಇಳಿಜಾರು ಅಲ್ಲಿರೋದು ನಿಮಗೆ ಕಂಡಿತೇ?"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹೋಹೋ, ಗೂಬೆ!","ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಆಕಾರ ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಅವಿತಿದ್ದಾನೆ?"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/66244-aakaara-matthu-liniyo-saahasa/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಶ್! ರೇಖೆಗಳೆಲ್ಲಾ ಮಲಗಿವೆ. ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳ ಚಿತ್ರ ಬಿಡಿಸುವುದು ಮಜಾ, ಆದರೆ ಸುಸ್ತಾಗುತ್ತೆ!"]}],"wordCount":93}